{"title": "The Blade of Frontiers (passive feature)", "pageid": 13904, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Blade_of_Frontiers_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp, /w/images/c/cf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Pact_of_the_Blade_Rapier.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>The Blade of Frontiers</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\">Rapiers</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The Champion of the Sword Coast, renowned for his heroic deeds and unusual stone eye.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Grants <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/25px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/38px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/50px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rapiers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/25px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\">Rapiers</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\">rapiers</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 641/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3229/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1964/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643822/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.466      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.466      1 -total\n 31.82%    8.739      1 Template:WeaponType\n 30.70%    8.431      1 Template:Icon_link\n 29.52%    8.108      1 Template:Icon_text\n 25.88%    7.107      2 Template:Trim\n 22.64%    6.217      1 Template:Ifempty\n 20.57%    5.650      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.70%    3.488      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 12.25%    3.365      